  "limits": [
    "Preferences are validated and forwarded as hints; the proxy does not implement automatic integrity negotiation or change future requests based on response hints.",
    "Duplicate algorithm keys, visible-ASCII restrictions and fixed budgets are local admission choices; opaque parameter duplicates remain allowed.",
